## Features

## Bug fixes

- Resolve hidden domain (time) signals referenced via the `relatedSignals` metadata element, fixing devices that connected successfully but delivered no data (signals had no domain signal).
- Retry initial metadata-fetch subscribes via a sweep timer, fixing signals that silently never appeared on devices that drop concurrent command-interface requests.
- Defer publishing a signal until its domain signal is published, so the domain link is not lost when metadata arrives out of order; signals whose domain signal never publishes are published without the link after a timeout, with a warning.

